| `e2e.sources.<transport>` | string | `rest` `openapi` and `mcp` `mcp-stdio`, plus `grpc` `proto` and `edge_nginx` `none` when answered | a key of `transports.available` mapped to `openapi`, `mcp-stdio`, `proto` or `none`: a closed set | `tests/integration/test_e2e_coverage.py` | Says how the gate derives a transport's endpoints from its code; an enabled transport with no entry, or an unknown kind, is red. | listing endpoints: the gate derives them and never reads a list | always |
